   First I would like to convert my data into genind object because I do not need to convert my het calls to ambiguous characters. I used bitwise.dist method because this can handle       SNP data with missing values. The reason behind using pvclust is I have ~ more than 1100 individuals and I cannot see their cluster allocation clearly on my screen and to extract      significant clusters, but this I can do in PVLCUST using pvpick. Which distance method I can use in aboot for individuals? Is it possible to extract significant clusters (>95%                   significance level) in abbot       also?. Which genetic distance method is more appropriate to my data (individuals with no population category information)?

